OL,3,AArgentina's bid to stop Falkland
OL,4,AIslands oil drilling rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FArgentina's bid to block an oil
OL,7,Fexploration project near the Falkland
OL,8,FIslands has been rejected by a
OL,9,FUN-backed international tribunal.
OL,11,FThe Argentinian government had called
OL,12,Ffor the venture to be blocked as it
OL,13,Fclaimed there was an ongoing dispute
OL,14,Fover the sovereignty of the Falklands,
OL,15,Fa British overseas territory. The UK
OL,16,Fhas repeatedly rejected Argentina's
OL,17,Fclaim.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
