OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AArgentina's bid to stop Falkland
OL,4,AIslands oil drilling rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a decision on Saturday, the court's
OL,7,Fpresident said there did not appear to
OL,8,Fbe any basis for believing it had
OL,9,Fjurisdiction as the tribunal is unable
OL,10,Fto rule on questions of sovereignty.
OL,12,FIn a vote 18 to 3, judges from the
OL,13,FInternational Tribunal for the Law of
OL,14,Fthe Sea rejected Argentina's challenge.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
